<?xml version="1.0"?>
<body language="English">
	<row id="msg_0072_D24R0101_00000" index="0">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Hm? That’s a Pokédex, isn’t it?\nMay I see it?\rThere are so many kinds of Pokémon.\nHm? What’s this?\rWhat is this Pokémon?\nIt looks like the strange writing on the\fwalls of the ruins.\rIf those drawings are really Pokémon,\nthere should be many more.\rI know! Let me upgrade your Pokédex.\nFollow me.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0072_D24R0101_00001" index="1">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Ouch!\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0072_D24R0101_00002" index="2">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Are you OK?\nI was in a hurry and...\fSorry, did I hurt you?\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0072_D24R0101_00003" index="3">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">No way!\nCould it be a Pokémon from Sinnoh...\fThe one they call ARCEUS...?\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0072_D24R0101_00004" index="4">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Oh, could it be...?\nARCEUS causing all this...?\rI cannot explain it any other way...\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0072_D24R0101_00005" index="5">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">ARCEUS may be the key to solving the\nmystery of the UNOWN and the\fRuins of Alph...?\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0072_D24R0101_00006" index="6">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Can you come to the Ruins of Alph with\nme? Please! You must!\rI am trembling with excitement.\nI think something is about to happen!\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0072_D24R0101_00007" index="7">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Ruins of Alph.\rVisitors who are interested in\narchaeology are welcome.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0072_D24R0101_00008" index="8">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Ruins of Alph.\rFeel free to explore the ruins and\nbecome a fossil professor!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0072_D24R0101_00009" index="9">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Ruins Research Center</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0072_D24R0101_00010" index="10">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">This is a mysterious hall.\nPlease watch your step.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0072_D24R0101_00011" index="11">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The Ruins of Alph. Older than\nJohto, older than anything that\fkept records.\rThe UNOWN here aren’t quite\nPokémon and aren’t quite WRITING--\fthey’re both, somehow.\rWe’ve barely scratched it.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0072_D24R0101_00012" index="12">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Silph sponsors the preservation\nequipment here. The ruins are\fdelicate, and the right\ninstruments keep them that way.\rWe’re guests, same as you--just\nbetter funded.\rIf your Pokédex happens to record\nanything unusual down here, the\funiversity would appreciate a\ncopy. So would we.\rNo obligation, of course.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0072_D24R0101_00013" index="13">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">UNOWN react strongly to pattern,\nto sound, to expectation.\rThat third one isn’t in our\nofficial report, naturally--too\fhard to quantify a FEELING.\rFascinating place. We keep finding\nreasons to extend the survey.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0072_D24R0101_00014" index="14">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The carvings shift at the edge of\nsight. Stare too long and you\fstart reading meaning into them.\rIn a cracked alcove, forgotten by\neveryone but the dust...</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0072_D24R0101_00015" index="15">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The carvings shift at the edge of\nsight. Stare too long and you\fstart reading meaning into them.</language>
	</row>
</body>
